  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A block of mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2.0\\text{ kg}\"></span> is initially at rest on a frictionless horizontal surface. The graph shows how the acceleration <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"a\"></span> of the block varies with time <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t\"></span>.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the momentum of the block at <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t = 16\\text{ s}\"></span>?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"120\\text{ kg m s}^{-1}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"160\\text{ kg m s}^{-1}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"240\\text{ kg m s}^{-1}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"320\\text{ kg m s}^{-1}\"></span></p></li></ol>"
